        "date": "2026-11-26T10:22:22Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(post): Haas NGC safe start, end retract, M4 and coolant-off codes\n\nhaas.cps now writes G94 in the safe-start block, G90 after each G91 G28\nretract (no G91 at M30), G53 G49 Z and G53 Y0 in G53 retract mode, M4\nfor a reverse mill spindle (millSpindleReverse), and the Haas off code\nfor each coolant option (M89 for M88, M84 for M83, M74 for M73). A G84\nunder a reverse spindle is refused by name. Haas leaves the app's\nM3-only post list. Behaviour from the Haas Mill NGC Operator's Manual\n(2025); see docs/decisions/1977-haas-ngc-words.md.\n\nG74 left-hand tapping stays open: the app refuses a left-hand tap before\nthe post runs.\n\nRefs #1977\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
